                <pb facs="0520" n="422" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg422"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 7.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Swenson to Mr. Jensen.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-03-14"><hi rendition="#italic">March 14,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The minister of foreign affairs advises me,
                    under date of the 13th instant, that your request to be permitted to remain in
                    Denmark until April 12 has been granted by the ministry of justice.</p>
                <p>Respectfully, yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Laurits S.
                    Swenson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
